><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">7</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_8\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">8</span></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;\">\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/An_imbalance_in_the_poppability.\" title=\"An imbalance in the poppability.\">An imbalance in the poppability.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oatmeal_and_death.\" title=\"Oatmeal and death.\">Oatmeal and death.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_end_of_the_franchise.\" title=\"The end of the franchise.\">The end of the franchise.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_customised_inhaler.\" title=\"The customised inhaler.\">The customised inhaler.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Croissants_is_croissants.\" title=\"Croissants is croissants.\">Croissants is croissants.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">A chair in a sweet.</strong></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_integrity_of_the_product.\" title=\"The integrity of the product.\">The integrity of the product.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_couple_of_Ethels.\" title=\"A couple of Ethels.\">A couple of Ethels.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Nothing_matters.\" title=\"Nothing matters.\">Nothing matters.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Caring_Uncle_Minpict.\" title=\"Caring Uncle Minpict.\">Caring Uncle Minpict.</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">A chair in a sweet.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/f/f3/A_chair_in_a_sweet..png/revision/latest?cb=20211028213829\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"A chair in a sweet.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/f/f3/A_chair_in_a_sweet..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20211028213829\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/f/f3/A_chair_in_a_sweet..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20211028213829 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/f/f3/A_chair_in_a_sweet..png/revision/latest?cb=20211028213829 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"A chair in a sweet.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"A_chair_in_a_sweet..png\" data-image-name=\"A chair in a sweet..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_12\" title=\"Series 12\">12</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Guz_Khan\" title=\"Guz Khan\">Guz Khan</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Croissants_is_croissants.\" title=\"Croissants is croissants.\">Croissants is croissants.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_integrity_of_the_product.\" title=\"The integrity of the product.\">The integrity of the product.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>A chair in a sweet.</b></i> was the sixth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_12\" title=\"Series 12\">Series 12</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 28 October 2021. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Guz_Khan\" title=\"Guz Khan\">Guz Khan</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_chair_in_a_sweet.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"A chair in a sweet\" was a phrase uttered by a baffled <a href=\"/wiki/Victoria_Coren_Mitchell\" title=\"Victoria Coren Mitchell\">Victoria Coren Mitchell</a>, as she tried to figure out what she needed to do in the <a href=\"/wiki/Sit_on_the_red_chair_in_the_secret_tower\" title=\"Sit on the red chair in the secret tower\">Sit on the red chair in the secret tower</a> task. The title card is a close-up of an iron, referencing <a href=\"/wiki/Land_the_iron_on_the_ironing_board_from_the_furthest_distance\" title=\"Land the iron on the ironing board from the furthest distance\">Land the iron on the ironing board from the furthest distance</a>.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_chair_in_a_sweet.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'En stol i et stykke slik', which translates as 'A chair in a sweet'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Tuoli karkin sisällä', which translates as 'A chair inside a candy'.</li>\n<li>On Sweden's SVT Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Vovvar och cirklar', which translates as 'Pooches and circles'. This title is simply referencing the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_a_cute_toy_for_a_cute_dog\" title=\"Make a cute toy for a cute dog\">Make a cute toy for a cute dog</a> task and the circular mats used in the <a href=\"/wiki/Sit_on_the_red_chair_in_the_secret_tower\" title=\"Sit on the red chair in the secret tower\">Sit on the red chair in the secret tower</a> task. The two Swedish words also rhyme, which makes it catchier.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'En stol i et godteri', which translates as 'A chair in a candy'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_chair_in_a_sweet.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Alan_Davies\" title=\"Alan Davies\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Alan Davies</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Desiree_Burch\" title=\"Desiree Burch\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Desiree Burch</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Guz_Khan\" title=\"Guz Khan\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Guz Khan</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Morgana_Robinson\" title=\"Morgana Robinson\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Morgana Robinson</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Victoria_Coren_Mitchell\" title=\"Victoria Coren Mitchell\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Victoria Coren Mitchell</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Most_desirable_thing_for_the_person_below_you_in_the_alphabet\" title=\"Most desirable thing for the person below you in the alphabet\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Most desirable thing for the person below you in the alphabet, or the highest alphabetically if you're the lowest alphabetically.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Land_the_iron_on_the_ironing_board_from_the_furthest_distance\" title=\"Land the iron on the ironing board from the furthest distance\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Land the iron on the ironing board from the furthest distance. The ironing board must be standing at it's maximum height when the iron lands on it and the iron must remain on the ironing board for the attempt to count.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_a_cute_toy_for_a_cute_dog\" title=\"Make a cute toy for a cute dog\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make a cute toy for a cute dog. The dog will have five minutes with your cute toy. Most engaged dog wins.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Sit_on_the_red_chair_in_the_secret_tower\" title=\"Sit on the red chair in the secret tower\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Sit on the red chair in the secret tower. You may only step on circles on your way. You may only stand on each circle once, unless it is black. You may stand on a black circle twice, but never twice in a row. Also you must put this task in the shredder within the first minute. If you fail for any reason, Alex will blow his whistle. Return everything to its starting position and you must start again. Fastest wins.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Make_paper_aeroplanes\" title=\"Make paper aeroplanes\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Choose the number of sheets you want for the second part of the task. Each sheet will reduce your points total by five.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">1\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">3\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><b>Live:</b> Make paper aeroplanes. Your paper aeroplanes must look like aeroplanes. Most points wins.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\"><b>19</b>\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>9\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/A_chair_in_a_sweet.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/chair-sweet\"><i>A chair in a sweet.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/70913-006\"><i>A chair in a sweet.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920141511\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.074 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.163 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 672/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26087/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 192/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.013/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 800098/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  105.707      1 -total\n 69.98%   73.972      1 Template:Spoilers\n 68.94%   72.877      1 